From 3449022c9e2a193b4071394366cbf6549bf5fb99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dgabehar <dgabehar@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:18:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] K2: hold EOG inside an unclosed reasoning block (tools
 offered); strip only known K2/Kimi markup from replayed reasoning

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BidfYiPxg2nUvGVowCgTPK
---
 common/chat-auto-parser-generator.cpp |  8 +++++
 common/chat.cpp                       |  6 ++--
 common/chat.h                         |  3 ++
 common/common.h                       |  2 ++
